WEBVTT

00:02:29.954 --> 00:02:33.038
or that you’re not motivated
by personal gain.

00:02:33.538 --> 00:02:36.704
Logos is the use of logic and reason.

00:02:36.746 --> 00:02:40.288
This method can employ 
rhetorical devices such as analogies,

00:02:40.329 --> 00:02:41.329
examples,

00:02:41.371 --> 00:02:43.954
and citations of research or statistics.

00:02:44.954 --> 00:02:47.454
But it is not just facts and figures.

00:02:47.496 --> 00:02:50.788
It’s also the structure and content
of the speech itself.

00:02:51.454 --> 00:02:55.038
The point is to use factual knowledge
to convince the audience,

00:02:55.079 --> 00:02:59.038
as in Sojourner Truth’s argument
for women’s rights:

00:02:59.079 --> 00:03:02.288
“I’ve as much muscle as any man,
and can do as much work as any man.